+## 2026-05-19 06:06 +03 - BE-0320
+- What was implemented
+  - Added worker-specific reconciliation coverage for deleted upstream service, changed worker build config, worker role drift, unmanaged extra service, service type drift, and worker missing-domain handling.
+  - Extended reconcile desired/actual service snapshots with runtime `Role`.
+  - Added dangerous `review_service_role_change` / `service_role_changed` classification that stops before safe build/env/domain repairs.
+  - Prevented non-web role desired domains from producing safe `ensure_domain` repairs.
+  - Updated the canonical reconciliation closed-set coverage table for the new role-drift action and reason.
+- Files changed
+  - `internal/controlplane/reconcile/types.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/reconcile/diff.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/reconcile/reconcile.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/reconcile/reconcile_canonical_test.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/reconcile/worker_test.go`
+  - `ralph/prd.json`
+  - `ralph/progress.txt`
+- Verification run
+  - Red check: `go test ./internal/controlplane/reconcile -run 'TestWorkerReconcile'` failed before implementation because reconcile services had no `Role` field or role-drift action/reason.
+  - Red check: `go test ./internal/controlplane/reconcile -run 'TestWorkerReconcileDoesNotBindMissingDomain'` failed before implementation because worker desired domains emitted a safe `ensure_domain` repair.
+  - `gofmt -w .`
+  - `goimports -w .` was not run because `goimports` is not installed.
+  - `go mod tidy`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/reconcile`
+  - `go test ./...`
+  - `go test -race ./...`
+  - `go vet ./...`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/...`
+  - `go test -race ./internal/controlplane/...`
+  - `go test -run TestMigrations ./...`
+  - `go test -run TestPolicyMatrix ./...`
+  - `go test -run TestQuotaConcurrency ./...`
+  - `go test -run TestFakeDokploy ./...`
+  - `golangci-lint run ./...`
+  - `staticcheck ./...` was not run because `staticcheck` is not installed.
+  - `govulncheck ./...` was not run because `govulncheck` is not installed.
+- Results
+  - All required Go checks passed.
+  - Focused backend and reconciliation suites passed.
+  - `golangci-lint run ./...` passed with 0 issues.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - Store/Dokploy adapters must populate `DesiredService.Role` and `ActualService.Role` when their concrete reconciliation snapshots are wired; blank desired role intentionally preserves compatibility and skips role comparison.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Worker is a role-level subtype, not a Dokploy `ServiceType`; role drift should be treated like type/engine drift and reviewed before any safe repairs.
+  - Background roles should not auto-bind missing desired domains; the planner drops desired domains for non-web roles while still allowing actual extra domains to surface as unmanaged drift.
